# (build 163) The retranslation's game over message (gameover_message's
# way): frameless text typed on the picture, his runs on the font's
# cleared fill -- nothing behind the glyphs, as the stock message has
# nothing behind its letters.
start battle $103
language retranslation
party 1 1
limit 4000
wait idle
press c
wait screen gameover
wait ticks 400
expect script $1218
expect text "Eusis and the others fell in vain,"
expect text "without bringing peace to Algol{47}{47}{47}"
shot 01_game_over
